fn test ok bool to void
note Direct write logger would clobber the very datagram being tested.
put Holdn 0 get Outlen 0
put Holdn 1 get Err 0
for i ulong get Outlen 0
put Held i get Outb i
end
check ok add get Checks 0 1
for i ulong get Holdn 0
put Outb i get Held i
end
put Outlen 0 get Holdn 0
put Err 0 get Holdn 1
end
fn hword off ulong v ulong to void
for i ulong 8
put Ph add off i uchar and shr v mul i 8 255
end
end
fn frame op ulong now ulong arg ulong size ulong to void
